## TIẾNG ANH · 16:30–17:00

**Q:** "How do meal reminders work in your app?"
> *"Preferences live on the server: wall-clock times plus IANA timezone. A cron job every fifteen minutes finds due users, enqueues idempotent push jobs, respects quiet hours, and logs every send. The phone only registers the device token and shows the notification — the schedule is not trusted to the client."*

